00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:05,210
Staying with a Project A long project can overwhelm even an industrious

2
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:11,658
student My first inclination was to work excessively and disregard rest The

3
00:00:11,671 --> 00:00:16,263
result was not extraordinary productivity but stiffness fatigue and a wish to

4
00:00:16,276 --> 00:00:20,684
desert the task I nearly let one difficult week destine the whole

5
